{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's fair shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nFrom ancient lands to modern grace\nA wondrous tale in time and space.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Gleam**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate\nThy weary soul a welcome awaits\nTo Shinjuku's heights a bustling view\nA neon dream both bright and new.\nDine on ramen rich and deep\nWhile city lights their vigil keep.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Tradition's Keep**\n\nTo Asakusa's shore we shall proceed\nWhere Senso-ji's gate doth intercede\nWith incense smoke and vibrant hue\nA timeless peace for me and you.\nExplore the market stalls with glee\nAnd taste the treats for all to see.\n\n**Day Three: Imperial Palace's Might**\n\nThe Imperial Palace a regal sight\nWhere emperors once held their light\nThrough gardens green and walls so grand\nA history held in this fair land.\nThen Ginza's shops with treasures untold\nA shopper's paradise brave and bold.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Mountainous View**\n\nTo Hakone's peaks we now shall roam\nA mountain vista a tranquil home\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene\nWith views of Mount Fuji ever green.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nA respite sweet a peaceful calm.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Ancient Charm**\n\nBy train we journey to Kyoto's heart\nWhere ancient temples play a vital part\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling gleam\nReflecting beauty like a waking dream.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant thread\nA thousand torii a path ahead.\n\n**Day Six: Gion's Geishas Grace**\n\nIn Gion's district shadows play\nWhere geishas glide in graceful sway\nA glimpse of beauty rare and fine\nA whispered legend truly divine.\nExplore Nishiki Market's vibrant fare\nA culinary delight beyond compare.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Grandeur**\n\nTo Nara we go with joyful pace\nWhere friendly deer fill every space\nTodai-ji's Buddha a sight to behold\nA story ancient bravely told.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns bright\nIlluminating day and night.\n\n**Day Eight: Return to Tokyo's Embrace**\n\nBack to Tokyo we now return\nLessons learned and bridges burn\nA final stroll through Shibuya's throng\nWhere modern life doth brightly throng.\nA farewell feast a joyful end\nA memory made a faithful friend.\n\n**Day Nine: Departure's Gentle Sigh**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid farewell\nTo Japan's wonders where stories dwell\nUpon the plane a final gaze\nAt lands of beauty in a golden haze.\nUntil we meet again my friend\nThis journey's tale shall never end.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0026434261817485094}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.1801649634435307e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.555946409702301}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.010431528091430664}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.10065241158008575}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -1.133439540863037}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.030084777623414993}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁fair", "logprob": -0.4006344676017761}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.3061831593513489}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.050094325095415115}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.005623236298561096}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.021419625729322433}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.04398273676633835}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.1668810397386551}, {"token": "▁sight", "logprob": -0.5630919337272644}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0005909841856919229}, {"token": "▁adore", "logprob": -0.19229531288146973}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.08680780977010727}, {"token": "From", "logprob": -1.116590976715088}, {"token": "▁ancient", "logprob": -0.2877739369869232}, {"token": "▁lands", "logprob": -0.7246233820915222}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.006471628323197365}, {"token": "▁modern", "logprob": -0.31534773111343384}, {"token": "▁grace", "logprob": -0.4429709017276764}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0006937957368791103}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -